.cache/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Model weights: 22 MB and fully regenerable by re-running exp/train.py.
# The CSV logs under exp/results/ are the results worth keeping.
*.pt

# STARE is fetched by exp/fetch_stare.py (19 MB from the Clemson mirror).
data/STARE/

# HRF is fetched by exp/fetch_hrf.py (76 MB from the FAU mirror).
data/HRF/

# TopoMortar ships its dataset inside its own repo (170 MB, MIT):
#   git clone --depth 1 https://github.com/jmlipman/TopoMortar.git data/TopoMortar
data/TopoMortar/
